{"seq":1,"slug":"legal-research-methods","title":"法学研究方法","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/law/legal-research-methods","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"法学研究方法-简介\">法学研究方法 简介</h1><p>法学研究方法是法学研究生开展学术研究的基本工具包。不同于本科阶段侧重法律知识的学习，研究生阶段要求学习者掌握系统的研究方法，能够独立发现法律问题、构建分析框架并产出经得起学术检验的研究成果。</p>\n<p>本课程从法律推理的基本形式出发，延伸到实证和教义学两条研究路径，最终拓展至跨学科法学方法，共设四个章节。</p>\n<p>第一章<strong>法律推理与解释</strong>训练法学研究最基本的思维技能。制定法解释的各种方法、判例分析的规范流程以及法律论证的逻辑结构，构成了法学学术写作和法律实务分析的共同基础。</p>\n<p>第二章<strong>实证法学研究</strong>引入社会科学的经验研究方法。法律定量研究运用统计分析来检验法律制度的实际效果，法律质性研究通过深度访谈和田野观察揭示法律运行的社会过程，法律文本分析则系统地挖掘司法文书和立法文本中的信息模式。</p>\n<p>第三章<strong>教义法学方法</strong>深入传统法学的核心研究范式。法教义学分析追求法律概念和规则的内在融贯性，体系解释确保个别规范在整体法律秩序中的协调一致，比较研究方法则通过跨法域的对照分析发现制度设计的替代方案。</p>\n<p>第四章<strong>跨学科法学方法</strong>拓展法学研究的视野和工具。法经济学以效率分析审视法律规则的激励效应，法社会学关注法律在社会中的实际运作，法与科技则回应数字技术对法律体系的新挑战。</p>\n<p>建议学习者根据自己的研究方向重点掌握一到两种核心方法，同时了解其他方法的基本思路以拓宽学术视野。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"legal-reasoning","title":"法律推理与解释","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/law/legal-research-methods/legal-reasoning","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"statutory-interpretation","title":"研究生 法学研究方法 — 制定法解释","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/law/legal-research-methods/legal-reasoning/statutory-interpretation"},{"seq":2,"slug":"case-analysis","title":"研究生 法学研究方法 — 判例分析","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/law/legal-research-methods/legal-reasoning/case-analysis"},{"seq":3,"slug":"legal-argumentation","title":"研究生 法学研究方法 — 法律论证","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/law/legal-research-methods/legal-reasoning/legal-argumentation"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"empirical-legal","title":"实证法学研究","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/law/legal-research-methods/empirical-legal","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"quantitative-legal-research","title":"研究生 法学研究方法 — 法律定量研究","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/law/legal-research-methods/empirical-legal/quantitative-legal-research"},{"seq":2,"slug":"qualitative-legal-research","title":"研究生 法学研究方法 — 法律质性研究","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/law/legal-research-methods/empirical-legal/qualitative-legal-research"},{"seq":3,"slug":"content-analysis-law","title":"研究生 法学研究方法 — 法律文本分析","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/law/legal-research-methods/empirical-legal/content-analysis-law"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"doctrinal-research","title":"教义法学方法","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/law/legal-research-methods/doctrinal-research","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"doctrinal-analysis","title":"研究生 法学研究方法 — 法教义学分析","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/law/legal-research-methods/doctrinal-research/doctrinal-analysis"},{"seq":2,"slug":"systematic-interpretation","title":"研究生 法学研究方法 — 体系解释","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/law/legal-research-methods/doctrinal-research/systematic-interpretation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"comparative-method","title":"研究生 法学研究方法 — 比较研究方法","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/law/legal-research-methods/doctrinal-research/comparative-method"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"interdisciplinary","title":"跨学科法学方法","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/law/legal-research-methods/interdisciplinary","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"law-and-economics","title":"研究生 法学研究方法 — 法经济学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/law/legal-research-methods/interdisciplinary/law-and-economics"},{"seq":2,"slug":"law-and-society","title":"研究生 法学研究方法 — 法社会学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/law/legal-research-methods/interdisciplinary/law-and-society"},{"seq":3,"slug":"law-and-technology","title":"研究生 法学研究方法 — 法与科技","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/law/legal-research-methods/interdisciplinary/law-and-technology"}]}]}